B.b8h=s(["Pery\xf2d sa a deja peye. Pa gen nouvo lajan k ap antre nan k\xe8s la.","P\xe9riode d\xe9j\xe0 r\xe9gl\xe9e : aucun nouvel encaissement dans la caisse.","Already paid: no new cash receipt will be recorded."],t.s)
