B.bas=s(["Retire anplwaye sa a? Anprent li ap efase sou t\xe8minal la nan pwochen senkronizasyon an.","Retirer cet employ\xe9 ? Son empreinte sera effac\xe9e du terminal \xe0 la prochaine synchronisation.","Remove this employee? Their fingerprint will be erased from the terminal at the next sync."],t.s)
B.bsD=s(["Pa gen anplwaye ank\xf2. Ajoute premye a pou li ka antre ak anprent li.","Aucun employ\xe9. Ajoutez le premier pour qu\u2019il entre avec son empreinte.","No employees yet. Add the first one so they can enter with their fingerprint."],t.s)
